[Music]  [Music]  do you think you can survive being stuck  in an island full of monsters and  predatory animals you could if there  were normal creatures a slim chance but  still probable sure you could scare a  tiger or wolves away with fire but what  if the island you're stuck in is skull  island and it's the one from the  monsterverse can you survive there for  at least a week before a rescue team  arrives and take you back to  civilization so here in this video we  will dive into what it takes for you to  keep safe till help arrives in skull  island and at the same time discuss the  monsters that are out there to kill you  and also survival techniques so  subscribe if you haven't already and now  let's get to it  let us first understand where skull  island is and how you could probably be  shipwrecked in that monstrous place  well since we are looking at the version  from the master verse it will not be  situated in the southern part of the  indian ocean but rather in the middle of  the pacific ocean  four thousand kilometers away from  hawaii in the northwest at the same  distance away from the mexican coast in  the north east of it and about four  thousand kilometers away from either  south america  antarctica  or the micronesian islands so there is  no way to send smoke signals for help or  any kind of sos ships won't be passing  through there anyway but luckily you  have a satellite phone that's just you  know how you could get out let's just  give you something hope  you could use that to call for rescue  but it'll take seven days  so how do you survive for a week in that  island  first and foremost you have to know what  are the dangerous creatures of skull  island then and only then can you  strategize a way to get through without  losing your limbs or your head  so what are the ones that are  herbivorous and benign and which ones  are after you the second you step into  that island  the harmless ones are small creatures  like the deers fern birds squirrels  and water buffaloes even the big  creatures like the triceratops the magma  turtles the skirt buffaloes and spore  mantises will not be harmful if you keep  out of their way these after all are  well and territorial creatures  protective of their young and  apprehensive of squiggly little humans  but what are the really dangerous  creatures  firstly from the air you have swarms of  leaf wings and psycho vultures that will  hunt you down and rip you to shreds if  they ever get you out in the open fields  or open space  in the swamps there are huge monstrous  siren jaws  and ambush predators like the vine  stranglers and swarm locusts  that are more than 25 feet long  in the forest there are huge spirit  tigers that will hunt you down before  you even know that they are there  there are packs of ravenous death  jackals that will relentlessly pursue  you and  you will have also mother long legs that  will stop unwitting prey amongst the  bamboo groves  even in the rivers there are these  gigantic maya squids and strange snake  squids  but the most dangerous of all are the  skull crawlers they can smell you from a  mile away and are always starving for  food so how does one navigate the island  and survive is it even possible  well as you can see from the movie  the two world war ii pilots gunpei ikari  and marlow managed to survive and even  find shelter among the eewee natives of  the place and yes even the natives the  eevee people have managed to carve out a  space for themselves to call home a safe  space for shelter and to thrive in  but this is partly due to their  allegiances to the king of the island  gong  which you will barely get any help from  since you'll you'll already be dead even  before you know where to look for him  but the thing is yes you can survive for  a few days or weeks in the island given  that you know what to do out there what  the dangerous things are and where these  dangerous creatures are located in  okay what are the five things you need  to do in order to live  you need to be invisible you need to  know where to be which is location you  need food and water sustenance you need  warmth and shelter and lastly you need  some sort of weapon to defend yourself  from threats or at least to deter them  from coming towards you  so first and foremost you have to be  invisible of course by that i don't mean  being literally invisible like the  hollow man but what i mean is that you  should not be seen hurt or even smell  you need to be extra quiet and not shout  out for help since there won't be any in  the first place any sound you make will  attract unwanted attention so move like  a cat in the corners and stay less  visible of course cover yourself with  leaves and camouflage yourself then at  the same time mask your scent with mud  or other pungent vegetation just to  minimize the smell of sweat coming out  of you  but that won't be enough you need to get  to a safer place from where you are  right now which would mean that you need  to know the geography of the island  the important thing you need to know is  bigger life forms tend to stay in the  center of the island and the nearer you  are to the coast the safer you would be  that's from jurassic park part three but  it's the same  skull island is filled with lush jungles  all over the place  there are these grasslands and lots of  mountains in the center of the place  even forests so you need to avoid these  and try as much as you can to traverse  through the harsh coastline and find a  spot where it is less forested and has  ample space for you to run away in in  the case a predator comes your way the  best is near cliffs but not necessarily  the cliffs more like near them  and avoid being too close to the water  as well there are dangerous creatures  like the maya squids there  next in order to survive and stay alive  for a week you need to build a crude  shelter with some sort of basic  fortifications  then focus on finding food and fresh  drinking water a small cave or a human  sized hole in the rocks would suffice  since you'll be out in a week you need  not concern yourself in building  something extravagant the truth about  survival in this place isn't being on  the top of the food chain but to be  unnoticeable  you should lower your standards and lift  like gollum from the lord of the rings a  dark and dingy place grubs for food and  on occasion try to catch a fish and  small birds but most importantly no  matter how thirsty you are ocean water  is a no-no  coconut water is okay or locating a  small stream is vital it's hot and humid  out there hydration is essential  now that you are done with finding  shelter in a small crevice or a hole not  necessarily a large cave as bigger  predators would easily enter these  places and have a banquet with your head  on the main dish you need to make  weapons to defend yourself or at least  the entrance and also flush out the  smaller threats that might be with you  in that hole what kind of weapons can  you make or find so given the fact that  you're stranded you would probably have  no gun with you and yes even if you do  it should be the last resort since a  sound of a gunshot will give away your  position and skull crawlers will come  one gunshot is dangerous too will  definitely tell every predator out there  where you are  so you should fashion yourself a crude  spear from whatever tree branch you can  find and strap a sharpened rock at the  tip to act as a spear tip dig yourself  in and face the tip outwards also you  can make a few spiked barricades if you  have time and a shield or a dough to  cover the entrance the thing is to be  well hidden  of course even with all this there is no  100 chance that you will get out alive  but it does improve your survival rate  barricading yourself in a hole with  bikes and basic doors or a kind of a  frame will deter predators that might  lurk into the coastlines since catching  you and dragging you out will expend  more energy than whatever nutrition your  body will provide them  they will most probably move on and find  other prey the last thing you need to do  is to radio in your position  giving landmarks as clues to your  location and telling them that you're at  least 300 meters away from a smoke  signal you shouldn't be seen in the open  with a smoke signal predators will just  come on and just snatch you out  [Music]  yeah smoke signals should be made before  their arrival the thing about evacuation  in the island is that this is one of the  most dangerous moments any delay in  getting out means your position is given  away the rescue team would be in danger  themselves and a second attempt would  almost be useless  so there you go the important things you  need to know in order to survive on  skull island for some time  so i hope you have enjoyed watching this  video and with that we come to the end  of it so do hit that like button  subscribe to be a part of the minecube  family and smash the bell icon for  regular updates on new videos right here  on this channel till the next one take  care fam

